---
import Card from '@/components/common/Card.astro';
import { COMPANY } from '@/utils/constants';
---

<div class="space-y-6">
  <Card>
    <h3 class="mb-4 text-lg font-semibold text-content-primary">회사 정보</h3>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-sm">
      {COMPANY.address && (
        <div>
          <span class="text-content-disabled">주소</span>
          <p class="text-content-secondary">{COMPANY.address}</p>
        </div>
      )}
      {COMPANY.phone && (
        <div>
          <span class="text-content-disabled">대표 전화</span>
          <p class="text-content-secondary">{COMPANY.phone}</p>
        </div>
      )}
      {COMPANY.email && (
        <div>
          <span class="text-content-disabled">이메일</span>
          <p class="text-content-secondary">
            <a href={`mailto:${ COMPANY.email }`} class="text-content-interactive-primary hover:underline">
              {COMPANY.email}
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
      )}
      {COMPANY.fax && (
        <div>
          <span class="text-content-disabled">팩스</span>
          <p class="text-content-secondary">{COMPANY.fax}</p>
        </div>
      )}
    </div>
  </Card>

  <Card>
    <h3 class="mb-4 text-lg font-semibold text-content-primary">문의 전 안내</h3>
    <p class="mb-3 text-sm text-content-tertiary">
      보다 정확한 상담을 위해 아래 내용을 함께 남겨주시면 빠르게 검토할 수 있습니다.
    </p>
    <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-sm text-content-tertiary">
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <span class="mt-0.5 text-content-interactive-primary">·</span>
        구축하고자 하는 시스템의 목적
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <span class="mt-0.5 text-content-interactive-primary">·</span>
        보유 중인 데이터 종류
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <span class="mt-0.5 text-content-interactive-primary">·</span>
        연동이 필요한 장비 또는 외부 시스템
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <span class="mt-0.5 text-content-interactive-primary">·</span>
        원하는 표출 방식
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <span class="mt-0.5 text-content-interactive-primary">·</span>
        예상 일정 및 예산 범위
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <span class="mt-0.5 text-content-interactive-primary">·</span>
        유지보수 필요 여부
      </li>
    </ul>
  </Card>
</div>
